WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:07.150
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.980 --> 00:07.150
Just like the cruel angel

00:07.150 --> 00:15.110
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:07.150 --> 00:15.110
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.790
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.790 --> 00:26.000
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.790 --> 00:26.000
Even though the untested breeze...

00:26.000 --> 00:29.800
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:26.000 --> 00:29.800
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.800 --> 00:37.470
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.800 --> 00:37.550
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.550 --> 00:44.730
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.550 --> 00:44.730
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.730 --> 00:52.070
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.730 --> 00:52.070
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.070 --> 00:55.950
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.070 --> 00:55.950
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.950 --> 00:58.870
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.950 --> 00:58.870
...that upon your back

00:59.530 --> 01:03.160
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.530 --> 01:03.160
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:03.160 --> 01:06.830
no hane ga aru koto

01:03.160 --> 01:06.960
...towards the distant future

01:06.960 --> 01:10.960
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:07.000 --> 01:10.960
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.960 --> 01:14.630
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.960 --> 01:14.630
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.630 --> 01:18.470
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.630 --> 01:18.470
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.470 --> 01:21.970
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.470 --> 01:21.970
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.970 --> 01:25.730
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.970 --> 01:25.730
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.730 --> 01:29.770
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.730 --> 01:29.770
Young boy, become a legend

01:30.830 --> 01:34.400
Mom! Mom! I've been chosen!

01:34.400 --> 01:37.110
I'm an elite pilot, chosen to
protect all of mankind!

01:37.110 --> 01:39.110
I'm the best in the world!

01:39.880 --> 01:41.580
It's supposed to be a secret!

01:41.580 --> 01:43.900
But I'll tell you anyway! Just for you!

01:44.350 --> 01:46.790
Everyone will be nice to us from now on!

01:46.790 --> 01:48.950
So, we won't be lonely anymore!

01:49.520 --> 01:53.580
So, we'll be fine, even without Dad around!
We won't be lonely anymore!

01:54.020 --> 01:56.540
So, look! Look at me!

01:57.070 --> 01:58.790
<i>Come on, Mom!</i>

02:07.080 --> 02:09.180
Synch rate, zero...

02:09.180 --> 02:11.940
Not qualified to be the Second Child...

02:11.940 --> 02:14.620
There's no reason for me to exist anymore.

02:14.620 --> 02:17.240
Because no one will look at me now.

02:17.240 --> 02:19.360
Not Dad, not Mom, not anyone.

02:19.360 --> 02:22.400
There's no reason for me to live now.

02:29.790 --> 02:32.990
Asuka Langley Sohryu, correct?

02:34.190 --> 02:38.210
Intelligence Division 2 reports that they have
the Second Child safely in their custody.

02:38.210 --> 02:39.510
I see.

02:39.510 --> 02:43.390
It isn't like Division 2 to take seven days to
find her on top of losing her in the first place.

02:43.390 --> 02:45.260
It's probably on purpose.

02:45.260 --> 02:47.980
Maybe they're trying to spite us
here in the Tactical Division.

02:47.980 --> 02:49.470
Possibly.

02:49.790 --> 02:53.230
And today, Asuka's replacement,
the Fifth Child, arrives.

02:53.230 --> 02:55.230
Everything is just too perfect.

03:03.010 --> 03:04.650
Rei Ayanami...

03:05.050 --> 03:07.950
So, that feeling I got really was her.

03:07.950 --> 03:09.530
Like Mother...

03:09.890 --> 03:13.030
Rei Ayanami and Mother...

03:13.480 --> 03:16.330
What are you doing, Father?

03:18.110 --> 03:19.670
Commander Ikari...

03:20.320 --> 03:22.130
The cat died.

03:22.130 --> 03:24.970
The one I'd left in my grandmother's care.

03:24.970 --> 03:27.180
I hadn't paid any attention to her for so long,

03:27.180 --> 03:30.380
but now, suddenly, I'll never see her again.

03:31.330 --> 03:34.560
Why did you destroy the dummy system?

03:34.560 --> 03:38.430
Not the dummy system,
what I destroyed was Rei.

03:39.340 --> 03:42.190
I will only ask you this once. Why?

03:42.190 --> 03:45.490
Because I am no longer happy,
even when you make love to me.

03:45.490 --> 03:47.790
Why don't you just have your way
with my body?!

03:47.790 --> 03:49.040
Like you did that time!

03:49.040 --> 03:50.960
I'm disappointed in you.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.290
Disappointed?!

03:52.290 --> 03:55.000
You never hoped or expected anything
from me to begin with!

03:55.000 --> 03:58.450
Nothing from me! Not anything! Nothing!

04:02.150 --> 04:04.800
What am I supposed to do, Mother?

04:06.700 --> 04:09.760
I wonder where Asuka is?

04:10.530 --> 04:12.890
But what would be the point in seeing her?

04:12.890 --> 04:15.430
Talk to her about Ayanami or something?

04:23.780 --> 04:29.270
Everyone, including Toji and Kensuke,
lost their homes and left.

04:29.270 --> 04:31.320
My friends...

04:31.320 --> 04:34.210
I don't have anyone I can
call a friend anymore.

04:34.640 --> 04:36.160
There's no one.

04:36.920 --> 04:38.840
I can't go see Ayanami.

04:38.840 --> 04:40.800
I don't have the courage for it.

04:40.800 --> 04:43.250
I don't know how I'm supposed to face her.

04:44.070 --> 04:47.670
Asuka, Miss Misato, Mother...

04:48.070 --> 04:49.970
What should I...

04:49.970 --> 04:51.920
What should I do?

05:12.050 --> 05:13.820
Singing is great.

05:14.260 --> 05:16.500
Singing enriches the soul.

05:16.500 --> 05:19.660
It's the crowning achievement of the
civilization that the Lilim created.

05:19.660 --> 05:21.700
Don't you feel the same?

05:22.400 --> 05:24.250
Shinji Ikari?

05:24.250 --> 05:25.590
My name...

05:25.590 --> 05:27.430
Everyone knows your name.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.760
I don't mean to be rude,

05:28.760 --> 05:31.560
but I think you should be a little more
aware of your position.

05:31.560 --> 05:33.440
You think so?

05:33.440 --> 05:35.100
Who are you?

05:35.100 --> 05:37.720
I'm Kaworu, Kaworu Nagisa.

05:37.720 --> 05:39.900
One of the children that's part of
the design, just like you.

05:39.900 --> 05:41.440
I'm the Fifth Child.

05:41.440 --> 05:42.940
The Fifth Child?

05:42.940 --> 05:45.570
You are? Nagisa?

05:45.570 --> 05:47.990
You can just call me Kaworu, Ikari.

05:47.990 --> 05:50.830
You can call me Shinji too.

05:54.350 --> 05:57.290
It appears the Fifth Child has just arrived.

05:57.500 --> 06:00.710
Kaworu Nagisa, his past records
have already been erased.

06:00.710 --> 06:02.500
The same as Rei...

06:02.500 --> 06:06.380
But the one thing we do know is that his
birthday coincides with the Second Impact.

06:06.380 --> 06:08.840
The Committee sent him directly to us.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.850
There's bound to be something to this.

06:10.850 --> 06:14.600
In the Marduk Report, the matter of the Fifth
Child is also designated as confidential.

06:14.600 --> 06:18.440
So, I did a little hacking into the
Intelligence Department's database.

06:18.440 --> 06:20.400
You're so reckless!

06:20.400 --> 06:22.260
It was worth it though.

06:22.830 --> 06:25.350
I found out where Miss Ritsuko's being held.

06:25.790 --> 06:27.990
How do you want to go about the
Fifth Child's synch test?

06:27.990 --> 06:30.030
Let's hold off on the trick questions today

06:30.030 --> 06:33.050
and get a straight reading
on what he's capable of.

06:33.050 --> 06:35.160
Fixing graph depth.

06:35.160 --> 06:37.000
Try lowering it another point three.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.200
Yes, Sir.

06:39.430 --> 06:41.710
Are these data readouts accurate?

06:41.710 --> 06:44.630
All instrumentation is operating normally, Sir.

06:44.630 --> 06:47.670
The Magi have not detected
any errors in the data, Sir.

06:47.670 --> 06:49.680
Who would have expected that he would
synchronize with Unit 02

06:49.680 --> 06:51.140
without the core being reconfigured?

06:51.340 --> 06:52.550
This boy...

06:52.550 --> 06:54.510
But this is beyond belief!

06:54.680 --> 06:57.390
This should be impossible, given the system.

06:57.390 --> 06:59.190
Nevertheless, these are the facts.

06:59.190 --> 07:02.580
First, accept the facts for what they are,
and then investigate the why behind them.

07:02.580 --> 07:07.990
<i>Central Dogma is currently locked down.
Please use Route 22 as a detour.</i>

07:07.990 --> 07:10.650
You're the First Child, aren't you?

07:11.550 --> 07:13.160
Rei Ayanami...

07:14.340 --> 07:16.360
You're the same as me.

07:16.720 --> 07:18.200
Who are you?

07:18.850 --> 07:22.000
It seems the Fifth Child has
made contact with Rei.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.130
I see.

07:23.130 --> 07:24.630
The Magi are currently pouring
all their resources

07:24.630 --> 07:26.750
into analyzing the data we got
from the Fifth Child.

07:26.750 --> 07:29.970
And yet, we still have no idea what he is.

07:29.970 --> 07:32.050
Who in the world is that boy?

07:32.050 --> 07:33.550
Do not enter without permission.
I'll kill you if you come without asking!

07:39.600 --> 07:42.350
Shinji still hasn't returned either.

07:42.510 --> 07:44.810
I've failed as a guardian.

07:47.080 --> 07:49.610
<i>Central Dogma is currently open.</i>

07:49.610 --> 07:51.860
<i>Please use Route 3 to transfer.</i>

07:52.110 --> 07:54.570
Hi, were you waiting for me?

07:54.970 --> 07:58.040
No, not really. That's not what I was...

07:58.040 --> 07:59.370
What are you doing today?

07:59.370 --> 08:02.160
Well, the regular tests are over,

08:02.160 --> 08:04.740
so all I have left is to take a shower
and go home, but...

08:05.430 --> 08:09.090
But the truth is, lately, I don't
really want to go home.

08:09.090 --> 08:10.590
A place to return to...

08:10.590 --> 08:13.510
The fact that you have a home
will lead to your happiness.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.760
It's a very good thing.

08:14.760 --> 08:15.970
You think so?

08:15.970 --> 08:18.390
I'd like to talk more with you.

08:18.390 --> 08:20.010
May I come with you?

08:20.700 --> 08:23.430
To take a shower. You still need
to go take one, right?

08:24.660 --> 08:25.860
Is that a no?

08:25.860 --> 08:28.720
Oh, no, that's not what I meant.

08:35.300 --> 08:38.860
You go to such extremes to avoid first contact.

08:39.260 --> 08:42.120
Are you afraid of connecting with other people?

08:42.120 --> 08:44.620
If you don't get close to others,

08:44.620 --> 08:46.790
you'll never be betrayed and
you'll never hurt each other.

08:46.790 --> 08:50.250
But you'll also never be able
to forget your loneliness.

08:50.250 --> 08:53.380
Humans can never banish
their loneliness for good,

08:53.380 --> 08:55.320
because being human means being alone.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.760
But humans are able to go on with their lives

08:57.760 --> 09:00.010
because they're able to forget it every so often.

09:07.160 --> 09:08.690
It's time.

09:08.690 --> 09:10.320
Is it over already?

09:10.320 --> 09:12.490
Yeah, we better go to bed.

09:12.490 --> 09:13.820
Together?

09:13.820 --> 09:17.450
Oh, no! I think there's probably
a room ready for you.

09:17.450 --> 09:19.120
A separate one.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.530
I see.

09:21.050 --> 09:24.610
Humans constantly feel pain in their hearts.

09:25.600 --> 09:29.490
Because the heart is so sensitive to pain,
humans also feel that to live is to suffer.

09:30.310 --> 09:34.170
You're so delicate, like glass,
especially your heart.

09:34.170 --> 09:35.130
Me?

09:35.130 --> 09:37.500
Yes, you have my regard for it.

09:37.500 --> 09:39.010
Regard?

09:39.010 --> 09:40.300
It means, I love you.

09:40.300 --> 09:41.510
EPISODE 24

09:41.600 --> 09:43.390
THE
FINAL
MESSENGER

09:47.540 --> 09:52.270
Nerv, the organization formed to be
Seele's executive branch...

09:52.270 --> 09:56.030
It was created in order to put
our script into practice.

09:56.030 --> 09:59.660
But now, it has become an organization
in the possession of one individual.

09:59.870 --> 10:02.700
Precisely, we must take it back.

10:02.870 --> 10:04.450
Before the promised day.

10:04.700 --> 10:08.330
Nerv and the Eva series must be
in their true forms.

10:08.500 --> 10:12.750
Ikari, you will bear the responsibility of
your malfeasance towards Seele.

10:13.230 --> 10:16.800
The time that has been given to us runs short.

10:16.800 --> 10:21.510
But the Lance of Longinus that stood
in the way of our desire is no more.

10:21.990 --> 10:24.310
Soon, the final Angel will appear.

10:24.310 --> 10:26.520
If we destroy it, our wish will come true.

10:26.520 --> 10:28.760
Just a little longer, Yui.

10:30.290 --> 10:32.680
Why am I here?

10:33.540 --> 10:36.480
Why am I alive again?

10:36.960 --> 10:38.950
For what?

10:39.260 --> 10:41.400
And for whom?

10:41.400 --> 10:44.240
The Fifth Child... That boy...

10:44.240 --> 10:46.680
I feel as if he's the same as me.

10:46.680 --> 10:48.410
Why?

10:54.020 --> 10:56.630
I'm glad we're on the outskirts of the city,

10:56.630 --> 10:59.080
because it kept you safe from all that.

10:59.300 --> 11:02.280
But there's no guarantee that will be
the case next time.

11:02.280 --> 11:06.060
So, the Horaki family will be taking care
of you starting tomorrow.

11:06.060 --> 11:08.560
This will be goodbye for a while, Pen Pen.

11:15.920 --> 11:18.530
Come on, I'll sleep on the floor.

11:18.530 --> 11:19.530
It's okay.

11:19.530 --> 11:21.910
You're the one who's doing me a favor
by letting me stay over.

11:21.910 --> 11:23.570
I'm fine where I am.

11:26.800 --> 11:29.320
What do you want to talk about?

11:30.220 --> 11:33.030
There are things you want me to hear, right?

11:34.190 --> 11:37.250
All sons of things have happened
since I came here.

11:38.110 --> 11:41.620
Before coming here, I used
to live with my teacher.

11:41.620 --> 11:44.390
The days were peaceful.
Nothing ever happened.

11:44.390 --> 11:46.960
I only had to exist there.

11:46.960 --> 11:51.980
But that was okay, because there
was nothing I had to do.

11:51.980 --> 11:54.270
Did you hate people?

11:54.270 --> 11:57.320
Not really, I think it didn't matter,
one way or another.

11:57.320 --> 11:59.850
But I did hate my father.

12:01.130 --> 12:03.900
Why am I telling Kaworu all this?

12:07.090 --> 12:10.410
Maybe I was born, so that I would meet you.

12:11.680 --> 12:14.460
How did it go? Did you get any data on him?

12:14.630 --> 12:15.920
Here it is.

12:15.920 --> 12:18.250
I borrowed it from First Lieutenant
Ibuki without her permission.

12:18.250 --> 12:21.920
I'm sorry I keep making you do
these theft-like things.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.630
What is this?!

12:23.630 --> 12:25.970
It's no wonder Maya can't release
this information.

12:25.970 --> 12:27.640
It's all theoretically impossible data.

12:27.640 --> 12:31.100
You're right. It only deepens the mystery.

12:31.100 --> 12:34.600
To think that he can freely set
his synch rate with the Eva...

12:34.600 --> 12:36.650
And of his own will at that.

12:36.650 --> 12:39.220
I guess this is yet again no time to be
worried about appearances.

12:40.250 --> 12:41.940
I'm surprised you made it in.

12:41.940 --> 12:43.900
There's something I want to ask you.

12:43.900 --> 12:46.070
All conversations in here
are recorded, you know.

12:46.070 --> 12:47.530
I don't care.

12:47.530 --> 12:50.690
Just who is that boy? The Fifth Child?

12:51.430 --> 12:53.710
He is likely the final messenger.

12:55.890 --> 12:57.040
Come on, let's go.

12:57.040 --> 13:00.540
Come with me, Adam's alter ego
and servant of the Lilim.

13:07.190 --> 13:08.720
Eva Unit 02 is activating!

13:08.720 --> 13:10.890
That's impossible! Where's Asuka?

13:10.890 --> 13:13.810
In med room 303! It's been confirmed!

13:13.810 --> 13:15.100
Then who in the world is...

13:15.100 --> 13:18.690
It's unmanned! No entry plug
is present in Unit 02!

13:18.690 --> 13:21.980
There's no one? It's not the Fifth Child?

13:22.880 --> 13:25.700
A developing AT Field has been
detected in Central Dogma!

13:25.700 --> 13:26.490
Is that Unit 02?!

13:26.490 --> 13:27.910
No, its pattern is blue!

13:27.910 --> 13:29.240
There's no doubt about it! It's an Angel!

13:29.490 --> 13:30.780
What did you say?!

13:31.890 --> 13:33.830
An Angel? That boy?

13:36.060 --> 13:39.000
Target has passed through Level 4
and is still descending!

13:39.000 --> 13:41.250
It's no good! We can't cut the power
to the linear carriage!

13:41.250 --> 13:43.010
Target has passed through Level 5!

13:43.010 --> 13:46.380
Emergency lockdown! Close all
partitions in Central Dogma!

13:46.380 --> 13:48.130
Buy us some time, no matter how little.

13:48.690 --> 13:51.310
Emergency lockdown, all Malebolge
levels being closed.

13:51.310 --> 13:53.720
All personnel, evacuate.
All personnel, evacuate.

13:54.160 --> 13:57.600
I never imagined Seele would
send one directly to us.

13:57.600 --> 14:01.600
The old men intend to step up
the schedule by forcing our hand.

14:01.960 --> 14:06.610
The final Angel has entered Central Dogma
and is currently descending.

14:06.610 --> 14:07.820
It's all going according to plan.

14:07.820 --> 14:10.410
Ikari, you were a good friend,

14:10.410 --> 14:14.660
a comrade who shared our aspirations,
and a collaborator who understood.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.620
This is your final task.

14:16.620 --> 14:19.320
I will be praying that it will be
accomplished by Unit 01.

14:20.980 --> 14:24.090
Unit 02 is breaking through
the armored partitions!

14:24.090 --> 14:26.170
Target has passed through Cocytus 2!

14:26.420 --> 14:28.380
Send Eva Unit 01 after it.

14:28.380 --> 14:29.260
Yes, Sir.

14:29.260 --> 14:33.800
Stop it from invading Terminal Dogma
at all costs.

14:36.980 --> 14:39.650
But why did the Angel take Unit 02?

14:39.650 --> 14:42.360
Could it be planning to merge with Unit 02?

14:42.360 --> 14:45.030
Or possibly to bring about destruction.

14:45.030 --> 14:46.530
It's a lie! A lie! A lie!

14:46.530 --> 14:49.530
That Kaworu is... He's an Angel?!

14:49.530 --> 14:51.240
That's a lie!

14:51.240 --> 14:53.160
It's a fact. Accept it.

14:53.160 --> 14:55.690
Move out, understood?

14:59.180 --> 15:01.170
Shinji's so late.

15:01.170 --> 15:03.250
Eva Unit 01 heading down Route 2!

15:03.250 --> 15:04.950
In pursuit of target!

15:05.900 --> 15:08.760
You betrayed me! You betrayed my feelings!

15:08.760 --> 15:10.830
You betrayed me, just like Father did!

15:11.530 --> 15:14.300
Unit 01 has reached Level 4.
Coming into contact with the target!

15:14.300 --> 15:15.840
There he is!

15:16.660 --> 15:18.480
I've been waiting for you, Shinji.

15:18.680 --> 15:19.890
Kaworu!

15:24.370 --> 15:25.980
Asuka, sorry!

15:29.130 --> 15:30.700
The Eva series.

15:30.700 --> 15:34.030
Born from Adam, they are an abhorrent
existence for humans.

15:34.030 --> 15:37.040
And the Lilim will even use them
in order to survive.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.610
I can't understand.

15:41.100 --> 15:44.290
Kaworu, stop this! Why?!

15:44.290 --> 15:47.300
The Eva are made of the same body as I am.

15:47.300 --> 15:49.970
Because I am born from Adam as well.

15:49.970 --> 15:52.680
I could merge with them,
if only they didn't have souls.

15:52.680 --> 15:56.460
Unit 02's soul has shut itself away for now.

15:58.490 --> 15:59.730
An AT Field!

15:59.730 --> 16:03.060
That's right. That's what you Lilim call it.

16:03.060 --> 16:06.150
The sacred domain where none may trespass.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.940
The light of the soul.

16:07.940 --> 16:09.900
Lilim, you know, don't you?

16:09.900 --> 16:13.490
That the AT Field is the wall that
everyone has in their heart?

16:13.490 --> 16:15.820
I don't know anything about that, Kaworu!

16:18.470 --> 16:20.250
Both Eva units have reached the lowest level.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.660
Target distance to Terminal Dogma, 20.

16:23.930 --> 16:27.790
If Unit 01's signal disappears
and another change occurs...

16:27.790 --> 16:31.340
I know. We set this place to self-destruct, right?

16:31.340 --> 16:34.300
It'll be better than letting them
set off the Third Impact.

16:34.300 --> 16:35.760
I'm sorry.

16:35.760 --> 16:38.450
It's okay, as long as I'm with you.

16:38.450 --> 16:39.800
Thank you.

16:44.080 --> 16:46.200
The fate of man...

16:46.200 --> 16:49.270
The hope of man is written in sorrow.

16:51.990 --> 16:53.240
What's going on?!

16:53.240 --> 16:55.780
It's an AT Field of unprecedented power!

16:55.780 --> 16:57.570
Light, electromagnetic, and particle waves!

16:57.570 --> 17:00.040
It's blocking them all! We can't
monitor anything in there!

17:00.040 --> 17:01.750
We're truly sealed off.

17:01.750 --> 17:04.960
We've lost the target along with
Eva Unit 01 and Unit 02!

17:04.960 --> 17:07.160
We can't contact the pilot!

17:18.650 --> 17:19.920
Kaworu!

17:23.280 --> 17:24.970
Wait!

17:36.090 --> 17:38.030
The final safety has been released!

17:38.030 --> 17:40.530
Heaven's Door is opening!

17:41.180 --> 17:43.740
So, an Angel has finally reached it.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.200
Hyuga...

17:51.850 --> 17:52.800
What's that?!

17:52.800 --> 17:53.670
What's the situation?

17:53.670 --> 17:55.050
It's an AT Field!

17:55.050 --> 17:56.970
The same kind of AT Field that we saw earlier

17:56.970 --> 17:59.600
has developed near the barrier
around Terminal Dogma!

17:59.600 --> 18:01.850
It's entering the barrier!

18:01.850 --> 18:03.810
It can't be! Another Angel?!

18:03.810 --> 18:05.350
It's no good! We can't confirm that!

18:05.350 --> 18:07.980
Oh, no, it disappeared!

18:07.980 --> 18:10.060
Disappeared?! The Angel did?!

18:11.870 --> 18:15.120
Adam, our mother.

18:15.120 --> 18:19.030
Must all who were born of Adam
return to Adam?

18:19.030 --> 18:21.270
Even at the cost of destroying humanity?

18:22.220 --> 18:24.270
No! This is...

18:24.270 --> 18:25.790
Lilith?

18:25.790 --> 18:28.450
I see, so that's what this is about, Lilim.

18:41.820 --> 18:43.850
Thank you, Shinji.

18:43.850 --> 18:46.800
I wanted you to stop Unit 02.

18:46.800 --> 18:50.060
Otherwise, I may have gone on living with her.

18:50.310 --> 18:52.480
Kaworu, why?

18:52.480 --> 18:54.360
Because it's my destiny to continue to live

18:54.360 --> 18:58.060
even if it may result in the
destruction of humanity.

18:58.880 --> 19:01.200
But I can also die here.

19:01.200 --> 19:04.080
Life and death are of equal value to me.

19:04.080 --> 19:07.660
Dying of your own will, that is the one
and only absolute freedom there is.

19:07.660 --> 19:09.240
What?

19:09.240 --> 19:12.790
Kaworu, I don't understand what you're saying!

19:12.790 --> 19:14.080
Kaworu...

19:14.080 --> 19:16.200
My last will and testament.

19:16.200 --> 19:18.330
Now, erase me from this world.

19:19.270 --> 19:22.370
If you don't, you will be
the ones who are erased.

19:22.370 --> 19:27.500
Only one life form will be chosen to survive
the time of destruction and be given a future.

19:27.500 --> 19:30.930
And you are not a being who should die.

19:36.250 --> 19:38.740
Your people need the future.

19:40.500 --> 19:44.240
Thank you. I'm glad I met you.

21:08.550 --> 21:14.750
Kaworu said that he loved me.

21:16.310 --> 21:18.380
It was...

21:18.380 --> 21:21.160
It was the first time someone
told me they loved me.

21:22.690 --> 21:26.290
He was like me, and like Ayanami.

21:28.070 --> 21:30.380
I loved him.

21:30.820 --> 21:34.090
Kaworu was the one who should have survived.

21:34.790 --> 21:38.300
He was a much better person than I am.

21:39.960 --> 21:42.820
Kaworu should have been the one to survive.

21:42.820 --> 21:43.570
You're wrong.

21:43.740 --> 21:47.060
Only those who have the will to live
get to survive.

21:47.840 --> 21:49.660
He wished to die.

21:49.660 --> 21:53.540
He abandoned his will to live,
clinging instead to a false hope.

21:53.540 --> 21:55.610
You did nothing wrong, Shinji.

21:57.100 --> 21:59.310
You're cold, Miss Misato.

21:59.540 --> 22:00.750
TO BE CONTINUED

